{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "7dd5ac8ce0e17b6f6b17b0cc51595f93842a02054a2e8b9cebe9504cb400d8c0", "ja": "青と赤", "zh": "蓝与红", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "24bbe23a58a3fae779e06dc778ee513a9d391ce70621444a7e1897ffe34eee67", "ja": "『Indigo Blue』と『Vermilion\nRed』に分かれて賞を競うことになった\n『I.V.』。面白がるクロエだったが、\nなるは真珠星と湊のことが気になり、\nリハーサルに集中できずにいた。", "zh": "分成了『Indigo Blue』与『Vermilion\nRed』两组，并要为获奖展开竞争的\n『I.V.』。克洛伊觉得很有趣，\n成却很挂心真珠星与凑的事，\n无法集中精力排练。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a929d7a6e0f2171a8d409c2c616a275352d58e7e0c7defe5346cf5d9cd20bc9e", "ja": "（第四幕。真珠星、藍、なる、クロエの4人は\n新生I.V.としてデビューした）", "zh": "（第四幕。真珠星、藍、なる、クロエ这4人以全新的I.V.组合身份出道）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1001_p", "source_sha256": "3c07844817ea949d6b8fdabf107375a074691a43fa1b8c3dbc0fda012f8d7892", "ja": "（彼女達の最初の仕事は、人気アイドルが\n大勢出演している、人気学園物ドラマのゲスト）", "zh": "（她们的第一份工作，是在一部有众多热门偶像出演的热门校园剧中客串。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1002_p", "source_sha256": "627fed938460008733595a3deb9529fd8f07a1ccdd71042d946dc5899b061a54", "ja": "（そこで真珠星は、なるの幼なじみでもある\n男性アイドルの真田湊と出会い、付きまとわれる……）", "zh": "（在那里，真珠星遇到了既是鸣的青梅竹马、又是男性偶像的真田湊，还被他纠缠不休……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "2ec2ca26e6aa8abbc5331eaa15d005b20bb8f3bce782a2446e7daf807fbe7848", "ja": "おはよう、なるちゃん。\n今日もがんばろうね！", "zh": "早上好，小鸣。\n今天也一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "43ebfd57f645923989cadd6546584829aaede2b93ccfbb999f73b3b97aa6569f", "ja": "うん、おはよう。……あ、あのね、真珠星ちゃん。\nちょっと、聞きたいことがあって……。", "zh": "嗯，早上好。……那个，真珠星。\n我有件事想问你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "453730b8e02dfe9eaaf993cfdd5aeb7fb05f8f4e7c6d81d3efc31022da0da753", "ja": "聞きたいこと？", "zh": "想问的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "4540ea666622d28dfe58bc31777a0ad3454ab7cd26c969c9e24a49ce4667856a", "ja": "あっ、ちょっと待って。\nスマホが……げっ！？", "zh": "啊，等一下。\n手机……糟了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "0c321e955c9fdb8be2a72dca6c3af47ae089ffa4c4277e8edd23b95bfc4f1862", "ja": "！　あの……誰から？", "zh": "！那个……是谁发来的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "d01411146b113772ed504d7639304257f6b2f4a0c68e343a5c775fe35b3aadb1", "ja": "えっと、真田湊……。「Astro歌謡祭、\n『I.V.』も出るんでしょ？」って。", "zh": "那个，真田湊……。他说：“Astro歌谣祭，《I.V.》也会参加，对吧？”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "5b4e09b774abb153d8dcb38449b2091cbeff41aa525881d065f26bef0a63b74e", "ja": "Astro歌謡祭……。\nそういえば、もうそんな時期だね。", "zh": "Astro歌谣祭……。\n说起来，已经到这个时节了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "20258fbbfb439cb06b2c7dc8fa673c49b603267c6cd5c16931958820299decf4", "ja": "名前は聞いたことあるけど……\nあっ。", "zh": "名字倒是有听说过……\n啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "11137b3125919fbd094d988775655d14bcd26552e8f913b2c383d240646fefe1", "ja": "お姉ちゃんが、新人賞を取った時の……。\nそっか、もう一年経つんだ……。", "zh": "这是姐姐获得新人奖时的……  \n这样啊，已经过去一年了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "8fff329caf0ad0900aed55ab55cb8b01ef17f142e93e031f364c4fdafa3f1467", "ja": "あっ。ご、ごめんね、なるちゃん！\nそれで、聞きたいことって？", "zh": "啊。对、对不起哦，小成！\n所以，你想问什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "34140b250d70345a861bd36895427acf6b07989a748c64226d5beda1cf32b93f", "ja": "う、ううん。もういいの。\n……行こうか？", "zh": "不，不用了。已经没事了。\n……走吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1016_null", "source_sha256": "1876e58b601318de94f3d9efd8aa2a1fe27a1abc6758f3db17408a10e25c521d", "ja": "Astro歌謡祭前日、リハーサル当日……", "zh": "Astro歌谣祭前一天，彩排当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1017_037nao", "source_sha256": "5a0eb3d2c455e4ea8597d086d8924ed8b65cf17e2bfba6288886361dd60da064", "ja": "ふぅん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "71370572f7e4138e1e7ad38beed15f83ebc51ed6a544f6879bffc303d5aeabe2", "ja": "藍さん……さっきから何？\n言いたいことがあるなら言って。", "zh": "藍……你刚才一直是什么意思？\n有话想说就说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "1b6d0b452d7b6025ad69192386d4544951ad037cc545b355c12132132a708221", "ja": "真田湊。", "zh": "真田凑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "7625dcd9bf18fb2d67772784c57633cb3e0dfb259e0424141c5c63dda4290845", "ja": "うっ！", "zh": "呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1021_037nao", "source_sha256": "9e8436436b4c2721f65e500ac5199ee10a163e38f583c443fe37d0995c5430c3", "ja": "いつの間にか、ずいぶん仲良くなったじゃない？", "zh": "不知不觉间，你们关系变得挺要好了嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "99a1628ab1bbc612857b5529ec54c5db03ebd00d7b8976d11cd915c1f7d9dcc5", "ja": "別に、そういうわけじゃ……。\n向こうが勝手に絡んでくるだけだし。", "zh": "也不是那回事……只是对方总是自顾自地来找我搭话而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1024_024ann", "source_sha256": "d237023bf44d56a412902fdae7d594801cbc63b71121a5c548b53095fb929301", "ja": "そんなことより、今回のAstro歌謡祭は\n少し特殊って？　どういう意味？", "zh": "比起那个，这次的Astro歌谣祭有点特殊？是什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1025_037nao", "source_sha256": "5630564720b9ad9de7e1cf1c2825ce32aadcf2e72cef76fcaa5ed4003e638a82", "ja": "この歌謡祭の審査は、会場だけじゃない。\nネットとテレビの視聴者が、投票に参加できるわ。", "zh": "这次歌谣祭的评审，不只由现场进行。\n网络和电视观众也可以参加投票。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1026_034ayu", "source_sha256": "123d6d66476494eb0213374da9d548169e83b6a69d4d1680837f496ad9920d1c", "ja": "リアリティショーみたいな感じってこと？\n面白いけど。", "zh": "也就是说，感觉像真人秀之类的？\n挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "fce66d047bda7ffd4083d2bcf59d7b9b461fa3ccc5366526bf1f4d2a9b1bf70b", "ja": "ええ。ただ、『I.V.』は私と織姫で、\n前回の新人賞を獲得しているでしょ。", "zh": "嗯。不过，『I.V.』可是我和织姬一起获得了上次的新人奖，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "82dce44a9582e89b42fd0d79ef2f7625a557934a58bf7ec2a10a232ae05c53e2", "ja": "まさか……私達、新人扱いされないってこと？", "zh": "难道说……我们不会被当作新人看待了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1029_042miy", "source_sha256": "500f1c444a5c8512bf0c6575fcd68c0fe1ed7b957bfcffa33dcd62459754cf45", "ja": "そんな……。", "zh": "怎么会这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1030_037nao", "source_sha256": "f759f3159f9eace1f6937ab4e72d8cab90fc4c319f6970dd3f5f61f45cb1f0b1", "ja": "そういうこと。\nでも、神宮寺さんが交渉してくれたから。", "zh": "就是这么回事。不过，多亏神宫寺小姐帮忙交涉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1031_037nao", "source_sha256": "74eaf140eabb6c6e2467d273e60a61469790080d6037ce79a051d794bf1e147e", "ja": "私達は『Indigo Blue』と『Vermilion Red』\n2チームとして、審査される事になったわ。", "zh": "我们将作为『Indigo Blue』和『Vermilion Red』这2支队伍接受评审。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "525d17e1903190e603e47977c33bc5a5a140b152c14bcb558fbd8506cd046832", "ja": "新人賞を獲れるのは、どちらか一方だけ。\n私達は同じユニットだけど、ライバルってこと。", "zh": "能获得新人奖的，只有其中一方。\n虽然我们属于同一个组合，但也是竞争对手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1033_042miy", "source_sha256": "d13f345a842d2b086c9f91ab18c5886e63803d213a83d953afa227a3d6489bf0", "ja": "藍さん、真珠星ちゃんと、\nクロエさん、私のチームで別々に審査……ですか……。", "zh": "藍姐和真珠星，克洛伊小姐和我分成两组分别接受评审……是吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "da5718fd0065e9ee77299b710bc1b0364979b45f3bb6529a45b7cb27690df631", "ja": "民放の番組にしては、面白い事するね。\n好きだな、こういうの。", "zh": "作为民营电视台的节目，居然会做这么有意思的事啊。\n我喜欢这种。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1035_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3905f4b177264d209e314589b4b2b184993e3d21f61f4711fa9ded874651d0da", "ja": "それとも……\n案外、持ち込み企画だったりして？", "zh": "还是说……\n说不定是自带的企划？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1036_037nao", "source_sha256": "35c6ab62619b2bd252fe670f6a3c7e1bdebf2055aee9d21e75abfa1c61ca35b9", "ja": "さあ、どうかしらね。", "zh": "这嘛，谁知道呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1039_037nao", "source_sha256": "db4115851a04403a7f4725a1c9a432f001d95826d0841d6f9f71e42b349167fb", "ja": "そろそろ、リハが始まる時間ね。\n皆、準備をして。", "zh": "差不多该开始彩排了。\n大家准备一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1040_banngumisutaffu", "source_sha256": "b8e9e117f7b12b402e6e8b05385c84c85328ca4066aef009e18773c8660b9460", "ja": "『Vermilion Red』のおふたり、\nリハーサル入ります！　よろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "请“Vermilion Red”的两位\n准备彩排！拜托各位啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1041_034ayu", "source_sha256": "1d3864fcb1a8f8240275e96480d114e802cff996d8c192cbcf7f3ef65fc4dbdf", "ja": "よろしくお願いします。……4人だけじゃなく、個別の\nリハーサルもさせてくれるとは、至れり尽くせりだね。", "zh": "请多指教。……不仅有4个人的彩排，居然还安排了个别的\n彩排，真是太周到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1042_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5234469d1839df5dd7efa2dcc786c3ce562c43e890da24a07c586ff842275889", "ja": "このステージなら、色々やれそうだな……。\n三船、希望はある？", "zh": "有了这个舞台，应该能尝试很多事情吧……。\n三船，你有什么希望吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1044_042miy", "source_sha256": "4be2b172db4d054b152ee2be99da3868de566adae08a3d6d4d7369e57d3b9463", "ja": "（真珠星ちゃんがいない……？　それに、湊くんも。\nふたりとも、どこにいったんだろ……？）", "zh": "（真珠星不见了……？还有湊也不在。两个人都去哪儿了呢……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1045_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f7233438ebb194f70813f2fad13178da96623f565cd269e6eea7f48ad1970468", "ja": "おい、三船。なに、ボーッとしてる？", "zh": "喂，三船。你在发什么呆？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1046_042miy", "source_sha256": "1102a8751997dab258cf803a62e051e2304d8f91e1df1d2ed5f71c6d01991730", "ja": "ひゃっ！？　あ、く、クロエさん！\nごめんなさい……！", "zh": "呀！？啊，克、克洛艾小姐！  \n对不起……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_03_1047_034ayu", "source_sha256": "36acc43cd40a03cc753f34ceeed6287165efc9f12c8ba5d00be7eb2ac532b917", "ja": "……。\n勝つ気、ある？", "zh": "……。\n你想赢吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
